menu "XL9555 IO Expander Driver Configuration"

    config DRV_XL9555_ENABLE
        bool "Enable XL9555 IO expander driver"
        default y
        help
            Compile the XL9555 (PCA9555 compatible) IO expander driver.
            Used for onboard KEY0~3 scan, beeper and speaker PA enable.
            I2C bus is managed by board layer (BOARD_I2C0_xxx in board.h).

    config DRV_XL9555_SCAN_PERIOD_MS
        int "Key scan period (ms)"
        default 20
        range 5 200
        depends on DRV_XL9555_ENABLE
        help
            Period of the key scan task. 20ms gives good debounce
            with 2 consecutive confirmations.

endmenu
